rarchies for reuse alone or exposing mutable fields publicly."],"one_minute_revision":"Object-Oriented Design: Workplace Lab & Module Check: Apply Object-oriented design assigns cohesive responsibilities to objects while protecting invariants through encapsulation and clear collaboration. Complete the scenario, produce evidence, explain the decision and correct the common failure: Creating inheritance hierarchies for reuse alone or exposing mutable fields publicly.","final_checklist":["I can explain the concept.","I can complete the activity.","I can validate and present the result."]},"quality_metadata":{"content_origin":"taksh_authored","review_status":"approved","copyright_review_status":"original","prompt_version":"deterministic-v2","generated_by":"taksh","sections_not_applicable":[]}}'::jsonb,content_version=content_version+1,reviewed_at=now(),approved_at=now(),published_at=now(),skill_tags=array['Java','Object-Oriented Programming']::text[],updated_at=now()
